# Appearance review captures, ALL of them including the compare--*.png sheets.
#
# The sheets were committed as the record of why the transparency and layout
# lines fall where they do, and that reasoning was worth keeping — but it is
# kept in prose. design-system.md §14-16 carries every measurement the sheets
# illustrated, in numbers that survive a re-render; the images were 35MB of a
# 60MB repository for a claim a table already makes.
#
# They stay reproducible: every capture flag that produced them is still in the
# app (--theme=, --transparency=, --wall=, --layout=, --backdrop=), so anyone
# arguing with a measurement can regenerate the picture rather than trust it.
docs/screenshots/appearance/*.png
